 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty busy, but good.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.61,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I left my umbrella on the bus this morning. It was my grandad's. Any chance of getting it back?",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "block": "public_transport.dlg7",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Quite a good chance, actually. Lost items usually go to the depot first and then to a lost property office.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "public_transport.dlg7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, and another thing. I take the subway about four times a week. Should I get a monthly pass?",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.1,
   "block": "public_transport.ctx2",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "At four trips a week, it's close. Do you also use it on weekends, or would you mostly pay per ride outside of work?",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "public_transport.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sorry, can you pause? Nina's asking me something.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.24,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instruction_v2_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Alright.",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is your brother back from university yet?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.47,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "near_miss",
   "phrasing": "dn_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Next Friday, he says.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.2,
   "phrasing": "dn_28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should we give our seats to that woman with the bump?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "I was just about to. You go, you're on the aisle.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What if she's not actually pregnant? That would be awful.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Just say would you like to sit down. Don't mention anything else.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.17,
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good point. Okay, going.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "See? She looked really grateful.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.91,
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Now I'm standing for nine stops though.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "block": "public_transport.side4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Done with my sister. Carry on, Moshi.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.46,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "side_cue_v2_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Alright. We were figuring out if a monthly pass is worth it for you.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
